'''Bloodgold''' is a [[Deep North]] metal.

It is obtained by smelting [[Petrified Tissue]] in a [[Blast Furnace]].

==Availability==
* Smelted from {{Item link|Petrified Tissue}} in a [[Blast Furnace]], one bar per ore. Each bar takes 30 seconds and burns two [[Coal]].

